OL,3,APubs, hotels and gyms in Wales to get
OL,4,A30% business rates cut
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaxes paid by pubs, hotels and cinemas
OL,7,Fin Wales will fall after the Welsh
OL,8,Fgovernment announced a 30% cut in some
OL,9,Fbusiness rates.
OL,11,FFirst Minister Rhun ap Iorwerth said
OL,12,Fhospitality, accommodation and leisure
OL,13,Fvenues would receive the permanent cut
OL,14,Fin rates from April 2027.
OL,16,F"It is about helping businesses like
OL,17,Fthis to thrive, so our communities can
OL,18,Fthrive," ap Iorwerth said on a visit to
OL,19,Fa pub in Cardiff.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
