OL,3,APubs, hotels and gyms in Wales to get
OL,4,A30% business rates cut
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cut, which will be funded by an
OL,7,Fincrease in the rates paid by
OL,8,Fbusinesses with the highest-value
OL,9,Fproperties, was welcomed by UK
OL,10,FHospitality Cymru. But the trade body
OL,11,Fwarned businesses still faced "massive
OL,12,Famounts of taxation coming from all
OL,13,Fareas".
